#: ../../api/palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.rst:2
msgid "HRGaussian"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:1
msgid "Regroupe les paramètres du rendu gaussien haute résolution."
msgstr "Groups the high-resolution Gaussian-rendering settings."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:3
msgid "Paramètres regroupés :"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:5
msgid "``Intensity`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`) : intensité intégrée fixe ou diviseur appliqué à la source sélectionnée."
msgstr "``Intensity`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt`): fixed integrated intensity or divisor applied to the selected source."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:6
msgid "``Fixed Intensity`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`) : impose la même intensité à chaque localisation."
msgstr "``Fixed Intensity`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox`): assigns the same intensity to every localization."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:7
msgid "``Shape`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`) : choisit une distribution isotrope, anisotrope ou de taille fixe."
msgstr "``Shape`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo`): selects an isotropic, anisotropic, or fixed-size distribution."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.HRGaussian.HRGaussian:8
msgid "``Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`) : écart-type utilisé lorsque la taille est fixe."
msgstr "``Size`` (:class:`~palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinFloat.SpinFloat`): standard deviation used when the size is fixed."

